<title>GERMANY: VW 9-mth net profit 465 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>VW 9-mth net profit 465 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>January to September.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			 465     vs 185</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		 1,481   vs 948</p>
<p>    Group sales			     74,487  vs 65,209</p>
<p>Car deliveries to customers (units) 2,986,977 vs 2,653,853</p>
<p>    Car production (units)		  2,741,914 vs 2,521,316</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German car maker is Volkswagen AG .</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
